{"id":"688ab84b1bfdaffd","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-monadic-connectivity.md","title":"一元存在二阶逻辑不能表达图连通性","display":"thm-monadic-connectivity — 一元存在二阶逻辑不能表达图连通性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-monadic-connectivity","aliases":["29-thm-monadic-connectivity"],"display":"thm-monadic-connectivity — 一元存在二阶逻辑不能表达图连通性","depends_on":["[[29-df-monadic-eso]]","[[29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology]]","[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 8.7 and Corollary 8.9, pp.128–129, scans 143–144; Theorem 8.22, p.137, scan 152","source_basis":"无序与仅带序的陈述及补查询公式均已核对图像；证明阅读与未独立复核范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-monadic-connectivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-monadic-connectivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-monadic-connectivity — 一元存在二阶逻辑不能表达图连通性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf492b2a5223a49a\" href=\"?note=cf492b2a5223a49a\" title=\"29-df-monadic-eso\">29-df-monadic-eso</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93bcfaaefa338233\" href=\"?note=93bcfaaefa338233\" title=\"29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology\">29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 8.7 and Corollary 8.9, pp.128–129, scans 143–144; Theorem 8.22, p.137, scan 152"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"无序与仅带序的陈述及补查询公式均已核对图像；证明阅读与未独立复核范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_0=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_0=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_1=\\langle E^{(2)},&lt;^{(2)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_1=\\langle E^{(2)},&lt;^{(2)}\\rangle\\)</span>；输入均为有限非空结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>。一元关系变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0^1\">\\(X_0^1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\)</span> 及相对查询类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cf492b2a5223a49a\" href=\"?note=cf492b2a5223a49a\" title=\"29-df-monadic-eso\">29-df-monadic-eso</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|,L)\">\\(\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|,L)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a> 的严格线性序谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau_0}\">\\(A\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau_0}\\)</span> 表示忘掉序符号的结构约化。</li>\n<li>下式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in|A|^{\\ell+1}\">\\(v\\in|A|^{\\ell+1}\\)</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell\\}\\)</span> 为定义域的顶点序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=0\">\\(\\ell=0\\)</span> 允许零步路径。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 是不同个体变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_0\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_0]\\mid(\\forall u\\in|A|\\;(u,u)\\notin E^A)\\land\\forall u,v\\in|A|\\;((u,v)\\in E^A\\leftrightarrow(v,u)\\in E^A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal U_0\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_0]\\mid(\\forall u\\in|A|\\;(u,u)\\notin E^A)\\land\\forall u,v\\in|A|\\;((u,v)\\in E^A\\leftrightarrow(v,u)\\in E^A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_1\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_1]\\mid A\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau_0}\\in\\mathcal U_0\\land\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|,&lt;^A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal U_1\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_1]\\mid A\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau_0}\\in\\mathcal U_0\\land\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|,&lt;^A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_r\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal U_r\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall a,b\\in|A|\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in|A|^{\\ell+1}\\;\\left(v_0=a\\land v_\\ell=b\\land\\forall i&lt;\\ell\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^A\\right)\\right\\},\\qquad r\\in\\{0,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_r\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal U_r\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall a,b\\in|A|\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in|A|^{\\ell+1}\\;\\left(v_0=a\\land v_\\ell=b\\land\\forall i&lt;\\ell\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^A\\right)\\right\\},\\qquad r\\in\\{0,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\coloneqq\\exists X_0^1\\left[\\bigl(\\exists x\\exists y\\;(X_0^1(x)\\land\\neg X_0^1(y))\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\forall y\\;\\bigl((X_0^1(x)\\land E(x,y))\\to X_0^1(y)\\bigr)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta\\coloneqq\\exists X_0^1\\left[\\bigl(\\exists x\\exists y\\;(X_0^1(x)\\land\\neg X_0^1(y))\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\forall y\\;\\bigl((X_0^1(x)\\land E(x,y))\\to X_0^1(y)\\bigr)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\left(\\mathcal C_r\\notin Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\ \\land\\ \\mathcal U_r\\setminus\\mathcal C_r=\\{A\\in\\mathcal U_r\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\delta\\}\\in Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\left(\\mathcal C_r\\notin Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\ \\land\\ \\mathcal U_r\\setminus\\mathcal C_r=\\{A\\in\\mathcal U_r\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\delta\\}\\in Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\exists J\\in Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal U_r\\setminus J\\notin Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\exists J\\in Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal U_r\\setminus J\\notin Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Theorem 8.7、Corollary 8.9（印刷页128–129，扫描页143–144）处理无数值关系的无向图；Theorem 8.22（印刷页137，扫描页152）把连通性下界加强到只有排序这一数值关系的情形。本条已独立查看这些页的图像，核对两种论域、不可表达性方向及补查询公式。输入域取简单无向图，原书的不可区分见证即单环与多个不交环，全部落在该域，故限制到简单图仍保留两个下界。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\mathcal C_1\\)</span> 的路径只使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>，序不参与连通性的定义。</p>\n<p>补查询公式与原书一致，且可在笔记内直接验证：见证集非空且非全域，并对邻居封闭，所以没有边跨过它与补集，图不连通；反之，不连通图取任一连通分量为见证。序不影响此论证。矩阵秩至多二，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 属于两词汇各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{1,2}\">\\(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{1,2}\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\mathcal U_r\\setminus\\mathcal C_r\">\\(J=\\mathcal U_r\\setminus\\mathcal C_r\\)</span> 得最后的不封闭断言。单顶点图由零步路径连通，且不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>；没有把空图的约定混入本条。</p>\n<p>证明阅读范围：8.7 的长环着色、交换两条边及保留局部类型的论证已阅读；8.22 的排列路径构造、移植游戏策略及排列群大小界的应用已阅读。这里记录原书定理作为出处，未独立重建 Hanf 定理的完整证明，也未核验原书 Fact 8.21 所引用的 Coppersmith 外部群论界。因此不把“陈述与证明已阅读”写成完整外部证明链已核验。尤其不声称带 BIT 的连通性也有同一下界；原书印刷页130明确把该加强留为问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-monadic-eso","status":"resolved","id":"cf492b2a5223a49a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-monadic-eso]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology","status":"resolved","id":"93bcfaaefa338233","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_0=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle$，$\\tau_1=\\langle E^{(2)},<^{(2)}\\rangle$；输入均为有限非空结构；$\\mathrm{STRUC}$ 见 [[29-df-struc]]。一元关系变量 $X_0^1$、$\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}$ 及相对查询类见 [[29-df-monadic-eso]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-monadic-eso","status":"resolved","id":"cf492b2a5223a49a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_0=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle$，$\\tau_1=\\langle E^{(2)},<^{(2)}\\rangle$；输入均为有限非空结构；$\\mathrm{STRUC}$ 见 [[29-df-struc]]。一元关系变量 $X_0^1$、$\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}$ 及相对查询类见 [[29-df-monadic-eso]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|,L)$ 取 [[29-df-ordering]] 的严格线性序谓词；$A\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau_0}$ 表示忘掉序符号的结构约化。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_0=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_1=\\langle E^{(2)},<^{(2)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}","display":false},{"tex":"X_0^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|,L)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau_0}","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in|A|^{\\ell+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=0","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_0\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_0]\\mid(\\forall u\\in|A|\\;(u,u)\\notin E^A)\\land\\forall u,v\\in|A|\\;((u,v)\\in E^A\\leftrightarrow(v,u)\\in E^A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_1\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_1]\\mid A\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau_0}\\in\\mathcal U_0\\land\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|,<^A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_r\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal U_r\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall a,b\\in|A|\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in|A|^{\\ell+1}\\;\\left(v_0=a\\land v_\\ell=b\\land\\forall i<\\ell\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^A\\right)\\right\\},\\qquad r\\in\\{0,1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta\\coloneqq\\exists X_0^1\\left[\\bigl(\\exists x\\exists y\\;(X_0^1(x)\\land\\neg X_0^1(y))\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\forall y\\;\\bigl((X_0^1(x)\\land E(x,y))\\to X_0^1(y)\\bigr)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\left(\\mathcal C_r\\notin Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\ \\land\\ \\mathcal U_r\\setminus\\mathcal C_r=\\{A\\in\\mathcal U_r\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\delta\\}\\in Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\exists J\\in Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal U_r\\setminus J\\notin Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau_r;\\mathcal U_r]\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{1,2}","display":false},{"tex":"J=\\mathcal U_r\\setminus\\mathcal C_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false}],"bytes":4013,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ajtai-fagin-game]]、[[29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology]]、[[29-thm-monadic-connectivity]] — Ajtai–Fagin 判据、无序与仅带序的连通性下界"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-monadic-connectivity]]"}],"outgoing":["cf492b2a5223a49a","93bcfaaefa338233","4f651c8d1bdc9a58","4de8e0c8085801f5"]}